          "title": "ASHLEY O'MAHONY",
          "text": "DATA SCIENCE | PROJECT | OPERATIONS | PRODUCT<br>Int'l MBA + MSc in Big Data | IE Business School (Spain)<br>MSc in Industrial Engineering | IMT Mines Albi-Carmaux (France)<br><br>+34 676 24 24 01<br><a href=\"mailto:ashley.omahony@gmail.com\" class=\"text-black\">ashley.omahony@gmail.com</a><br>Madrid, Spain<br>",
          "buttons": " <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ashleyomahony/\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"socicon socicon-linkedin mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>LINKEDIN</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"http://github.com/ashomah\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"socicon socicon-github mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>GITHUB</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://twitter.com/AshleyOMahony\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"socicon socicon-twitter mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>TWITTER</a> <a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"http://ashleyomahony.com/Ashley_OMahony.vcf\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"socicon socicon-persona mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>VCARD</a>"
