            }
          },
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-g",
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": false,
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#efefef"
          },
          "title": "EXPERIENCE",
          "meta": ""
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_styles": {
            "P": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "font-size": "17px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "content6-j",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">GLOBAL COMMERCIAL ANALYST</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Feb 2016 - Dec 2017</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>MOTHERCARE</b> | <b>London</b> | <b>UK</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Subject-Matter Expert Sourcing&nbsp;-&nbsp;Oracle Retail Project</span><br></p><p><i>Represent the Sourcing Division in the Oracle Retail implementation project, acting as a liaison between programme design team, business and technical functions.\n</i></p><p><i>Document process design and functionalities requirements, leading in delivery of Quick Wins solutions, ensuring implementation of standardized and consistent ways of working.\n</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"http://www.mothercare.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.mothercare.com</a></i><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-n",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">GLOBAL ANALYST</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Sep 2013 - Jan 2016</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>MOTHERCARE</b> | <b>Hong Kong</b>&nbsp;| <b>China</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Business Analysis - Vendor Management</span></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Review and report business KPI to emphasize key business drivers, financial impact of strategic initiatives and competitor information.</i><br></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Work with IT teams on existing systems and databases to improve efficiency and accuracy of reports. Help to define and monitor the supplier strategy for each country and each product category.</i><br></p><p><i><a href=\"http://www.mothercare.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.mothercare.com</a></i></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-r",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>TRIMS &amp; FURNITURE MANAGER</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Feb 2012 - Dec 2012</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>DEVANLAY LACOSTE</b> | <b>Hong Kong</b>&nbsp;| <b>China</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Team of 7 people, located in Shanghai</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Trims, Furniture and Point-Of-Sales Materials Purchasing</span></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Secure procurement flows and inventory of the Lacoste’s logos.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Implement a unique labelling service provider for the region.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Extend the suppliers panel and ensure the compliance of furniture and POS sales with Lacoste’s standards.</i></p><p><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Develop a Support Service for the Lacoste Asian Production Licensees.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.lacoste.com</a><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"http://www.mothercare.com\" target=\"_blank\"></a></i><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-s",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>BUSINESS ANALYST</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Feb 2011 - Jan 2012</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>DEVANLAY LACOSTE</b> | <b>Hong Kong</b>&nbsp;| <b>China</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Reporting - Supply Chain&nbsp;Planning -&nbsp;Project Management</span></p><p><i>Reengineer the delivery KPI and dashboards. Conduct Sales and Operations Planning (S&amp;OP) meetings.</i></p><p><i>Lead the Labels Standardization Project for Asia area, complying with legal and distribution constraints.</i></p><p><i>Deploy an ordering web interface to 40 Asian suppliers.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\">www.lacoste.com</a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-u",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>SUPPLY CHAIN ENGINEER</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Oct 2009 - Jan 2011</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>DEVANLAY LACOSTE</b> | <b>Shanghai</b>&nbsp;| <b>China</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Organisation Processes Audits - Suppliers Management</span></p><p><i>Perform selective audits and improve procedures efficiency and performance in supply chain, logistics, supplier management and quality.</i></p><p><i>Implement the supplier qualification process and design a tool evaluating the suppliers’ performance.</i></p><p><i>Regularize suppliers’ contracts, and social and environmental compliance certificates.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\">www.lacoste.com</a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-v",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "5",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>PROJECT ENGINEER</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Oct 2007 - May 2009</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>LGM</b> | <b>Paris</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"http://www.lgmgroup.fr\" target=\"_blank\">www.lgmgroup.fr</a></span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">SNCF - Simulation of Logistics Flows in Maintenance Centres</span></p><p><i>Audit in 26 centres all over France.</i></p><p><i>Model and simulate new organizations scenario in ExtendSim to define an optimal solution.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.sncf.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.sncf.com</a><i></i></p><p>Renault Trucks Défense - Project Management Support</p><p><i>Develop and install project management tools (cost control, planning, technical issues follow-up).</i></p><p><i>Assist the project managers by monitoring the action plans and coordinating the prototype parts stock.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.renault-trucks-defense.eu\" target=\"_blank\">www.renault-trucks-defense.eu</a><a href=\"www.renault-trucks-defense.eu\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p>"
        },
        {
