          "title": "EDUCATION",
          "meta": ""
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\"><b>MASTER IN BUSINESS ANALYTICS AND BIG DATA</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Oct 2018 - Jul 2019</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>IE SCHOOL OF HUMAN SCIENCES &amp; TECHNOLOGY</b>&nbsp;| <b>Madrid</b>&nbsp;| <b>Spain</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">#3 European Master, #10 Worldwide - <a href=\"https://www.topuniversities.com/university-rankings/business-masters-rankings/business-analytics/2018\" target=\"_blank\">QS World Ranking 2018</a></span><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ie.edu\" target=\"_blank\">www.ie.edu</a><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-2d"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\"><b>INTERNATIONAL MBA</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem;\">Jan 2018 - Jul 2019</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>IE BUSINESS SCHOOL</b>&nbsp;| <b>Madrid</b>&nbsp;| <b>Spain</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">#3 European Business School, #8 Worldwide - <a href=\"http://rankings.ft.com/businessschoolrankings/ie-business-school\" target=\"_blank\">FT Ranking 2017</a></span><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ie.edu\" target=\"_blank\">www.ie.edu</a><br></p>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-2b"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-x",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": "2",
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>MASTER'S DEGREE IN INDUSTRIAL ENGINEERING</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">2003 - 2007</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>IMT MINES ALBI-CARMAUX</b> | <b>Albi</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Graduate School of Engineering - French 'Grandes Ecoles'</span><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.mines-albi.fr\" target=\"_blank\">www.mines-albi.fr</a><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\"></a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-y",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>INTERNSHIP</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Feb 2007 - Jul 2007</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>ISA FRANCE</b> | <b>Besançon</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Initialization of the ERP Implementation</span></p><p><i>Audit the decision process.&nbsp;</i><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Collect production key-data.&nbsp;</i><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Develop a planning tool (Excel VBA).&nbsp;</i><i style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Train the final users.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.isafrance.com/en/home.html\" target=\"_blank\">www.isafrance.com</a><a href=\"http://www.lacoste.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\"></a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-z",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": 1,
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>INTERNSHIP</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">May 2006 - Aug 2006</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>EMR</b> | <b>La Réunion</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Reengineering of the Core-Business Process</span></p><p><i>Redefine physical and information flows. Write job descriptions and procedures, and organize the shared network. Set up inventory and quality management tools. Design a CRM model.</i></p><p><a href=\"http://www.emr-oi.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.emr-oi.com</a><a href=\"http://www.isafrance.com/en/home.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\"></a><br></p>"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content6",
          "_anchor": "content6-10",
          "_params": {
            "paddingTop": 1,
            "paddingBottom": "5",
            "bgColor": "#fff"
          },
          "text1": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\"><b>INTERNSHIP</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; line-height: 1.5;\">May 2005 - Aug 2005</span><br></p>",
          "text2": "<p><b>BOSCH REXROTH</b> | <b>Lyon</b>&nbsp;| <b>France</b></p><p>Stock Accuracy Project</p><p><i>Support new process execution by auditing production lines, creating tailored forms and training staffs to ERP (SAP).</i></p><p><a href=\"https://www.boschrexroth.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.boschrexroth.com</a><a href=\"http://www.isafrance.com/en/home.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 1.07rem; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5;\"></a><br></p>"
        },
